        <Shape name="baleTrigger" shapeId="12" kinematic="true" compound="true" trigger="true" collisionFilterGroup="0x20000000" collisionFilterMask="0x40000" clipDistance="600" nodeId="50" castsShadows="false" receiveShadows="false" nonRenderable="true" materialIds="11"/>
        <TransformGroup name="unloadTriggerAINode" translation="0 0 -6.2" nodeId="51"/>
